// SOUNDNESS QUEUE row foreach_array_rvalue_elements_never_dropped_run (tier 1, run 1). `for d in [D{1}, D{10}]` NEVER DESTROYS ANY ELEMENT.
// Each iteration moves one element into `d` and drops it at the end of the body: rustc s=11 n=11. TODAY s=11 n=0, exit 1 — neither
