// ⚠ THIS ROW OWNS A SCAFFOLD IN THE COMPILER: SemaChecker::lower_arr_lit / lower_arr_fill_lit do NOT mark the elements of an array
// literal that IS a for-each iterable consumed (carrier in_foreach_iterable_, set by SemaChecker::lower_for_each). That exception
// exists only because nothing drops the iterable or the loop variable here; when this row closes, delete the exception and the carrier.
// Named as a shape of aggregate_literal_temp_place_base_never_dropped_run's SYMPTOM (that row CLOSED 2026-09-15g-aggtemp landing; its
// program is now pass/bc_0915g_aggtemp_arrlit_place_base_dropped_admit); round 2026-09-15g-aggtemp MEASURED it is not
// that defect: no arm of the door moves it (0 under ptown / ptownx / ptownxf, hand a04 t06), and marking the elements consumed
// (ptownx) turns k10 into this same leak. Reason 1: the fact — who owns the element an array for-each binds — has no carrier in
